request.description:
Fetch a user's saved portfolio (holdings + last analysis results). Replace :userId with the authenticated user's ID.

Expected response: the portfolio document directly — { _id, userId, holdings, totalValue, riskScore, sharpeRatio, ... }

Note: the document is returned at the top level, not wrapped in a { portfolio: ... } envelope.

Fetch and analyze live financial news. Results are cached per query for 10 minutes.

Query params: query — search terms (optional).

Expected response: { articles: [{ title, source, sentiment, sentimentScore, url, publishedAt }] }

body.raw:
